  'The animation studio of the form family. Its shell, panels and colors come from the form image editor and the form effects editor, and its movie files are its own. Interface fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono; movie files use fflate; video and sound use mediabunny.': "Studio animasi dari keluarga form. Cangkang, panel, dan warnanya berasal dari editor gambar form dan editor efek form, sedangkan berkas filmnya miliknya sendiri. Font antarmuka adalah Inter dan JetBrains Mono; berkas film memakai fflate; video dan suara memakai mediabunny.",
