  'Use headphones when the movie’s sound plays, or the microphone hears it too. Takes are saved as WAV sound in the movie file.': "Gunakan headphone saat suara film diputar, kalau tidak mikrofon ikut menangkapnya. Take disimpan sebagai suara WAV di berkas film.",
  'Pan': "Pan", 'Centre': "Tengah", 'Fade in': "Fade in", 'Fade out': "Fade out", 'Key level': "Keyframe level", 'Key pan': "Keyframe pan", 'Normalize': "Normalisasi", 'Audio scrubbing': "Scrubbing audio", 'Mute track': "Bisukan trek", 'Solo track': "Solokan trek", 'Fade In': "Fade In", 'Fade Out': "Fade Out", 'Key Level': "Keyframe Level", 'Key Pan': "Keyframe Pan", 'Use Take': "Gunakan Take", 'Delete Take': "Hapus Take", 'Record Voice take': "Rekam Take Suara", 'Voice take': "Take suara",
  'formmorpheus is not allowed to use the microphone. Allow microphone access for formmorpheus in your system settings (or the browser’s site settings), then press Try again.': "formmorpheus tidak diizinkan memakai mikrofon. Izinkan akses mikrofon untuk formmorpheus di pengaturan sistem (atau pengaturan situs peramban), lalu tekan Coba lagi.",
  'No microphone was found. Plug one in or pick another input, then press Try again.': "Mikrofon tidak ditemukan. Colokkan satu atau pilih input lain, lalu tekan Coba lagi.",
  'The microphone is busy or unavailable: another app may be using it. Close it, then press Try again.': "Mikrofon sibuk atau tidak tersedia: mungkin aplikasi lain sedang memakainya. Tutup aplikasi itu, lalu tekan Coba lagi.",
  'This page cannot reach a microphone. Recording needs the desktop app or a secure (https or localhost) page.': "Halaman ini tidak dapat mengakses mikrofon. Perekaman memerlukan aplikasi desktop atau halaman aman (https atau localhost).",
