  "Draw from a tablet's browser with its pen pressure and tilt, over your own network, paired by a code.": "Gambar dari browser tablet dengan tekanan dan kemiringan pena, lewat jaringan Anda sendiri, dipasangkan dengan kode.", "Brush files bring their settings, folders and textures, with a preview of every brush before it lands.": "File kuas membawa pengaturan, folder, dan teksturnya, dengan pratinjau setiap kuas sebelum diimpor.", "Brush presets": "Preset kuas", "Hold at the end of a stroke to snap it to a line, arc, ellipse, rectangle or polygon.": "Tahan di akhir goresan agar merapat ke garis, busur, elips, persegi panjang, atau poligon.", "Names, hide, lock, mute and solo beside the tracks, and drops that make a new track.": "Nama, sembunyikan, kunci, bisukan, dan solo di samping trek, serta penjatuhan yang membuat trek baru.", "New movies appear in the Theater at once and every change is saved as you work.": "Film baru langsung muncul di Teater dan setiap perubahan disimpan saat Anda bekerja.", "Oil streaks hair by hair and picks up the paint below; watercolor pools at its edges and bleeds while wet.": "Cat minyak menggores helai demi helai dan mengambil cat di bawahnya; cat air menggenang di tepinya dan melebar selagi basah.", "Pen tablets": "Tablet pena", "Pens and tablets, brush presets and a closer feel": "Pena dan tablet, preset kuas, dan rasa yang lebih dekat", "Perform retakes": "Ambil ulang di Tampil", "Pressure, tilt, the eraser end and barrel buttons, with a test pad, a pressure curve and palm rejection in Preferences.": "Tekanan, kemiringan, ujung penghapus, dan tombol pena, dengan area uji, kurva tekanan, dan penolakan telapak di Preferensi.", "Real oil and watercolor": "Cat minyak dan cat air asli", "Retake, a pre-roll and a punch range, and keys to turn and scale with a mouse.": "Ambil ulang, pra-putar, dan rentang punch, serta tombol untuk memutar dan mengubah skala dengan mouse.", "Saves itself": "Menyimpan sendiri",
  "Added {n} markers on beats.": "{n} penanda ditambahkan pada ketukan.", "control {n}": "kontrol {n}", "Size {n} px is capped at 400 px.": "Ukuran {n} px dibatasi hingga 400 px.",
