  "Position scatter": "Sebaran posisi", "Moves every stamp a random way off the path, as a share of its size.": "Menggeser setiap stempel secara acak dari jalur, sebagai bagian dari ukurannya.", "How far the stamp turns with the direction of the stroke: 100 follows it, 0 holds still, -100 turns against it.": "Seberapa jauh stempel berputar mengikuti arah goresan: 100 mengikutinya, 0 diam, -100 berputar berlawanan.",
  "Improved": "Ditingkatkan", "How the stamp picture is sampled when it is drawn: None keeps hard pixels, Classic is smooth, Improved is smoothest.": "Cara gambar stempel disampel saat digambar: Tidak ada mempertahankan piksel keras, Klasik halus, Ditingkatkan paling halus.", "Rotation follows stroke": "Rotasi mengikuti goresan",
